# 中频词汇 List02
# 领域: 考研
# 学科: 英语词汇
# 来源: 2023恋练有词
# 描述: 中频词汇List02核心词汇

{{appraisal}}{/əˈpreɪzl/}{评价；估价}{The manager conducted a performance appraisal for each employee.}}
{{arrange}}{/əˈreɪndʒ/}{安排；整理}{She arranged the flowers in a beautiful vase.}}
{{article}}{/ˈɑːtɪkl/}{文章；条款；冠词}{The article was published in a leading journal.}}
{{aspect}}{/ˈæspekt/}{方面；外观}{We must consider every aspect of the problem.}}
{{assemble}}{/əˈsembl/}{集合；组装}{The workers assembled the parts on the production line.}}
{{assumption}}{/əˈsʌmpʃn/}{假设；假定}{The assumption that all students learn the same way is flawed.}}
{{atmosphere}}{/ˈætməsfɪər/}{气氛；大气层}{The restaurant has a relaxed atmosphere.}}
{{attempt}}{/əˈtempt/}{尝试；企图}{He attempted to solve the puzzle but gave up.}}
{{attitude}}{/ˈætɪtjuːd/}{态度；看法}{A positive attitude can make a big difference.}}
{{attract}}{/əˈtrækt/}{吸引；引起}{The city attracts millions of tourists every year.}}
{{audit}}{/ˈɔːdɪt/}{审计；审查}{The company underwent an external financial audit.}}
{{authentic}}{/ɔːˈθentɪk/}{真实的；正宗的}{The restaurant serves authentic Italian cuisine.}}
{{automatic}}{/ˌɔːtəˈmætɪk/}{自动的；无意识的}{The doors have an automatic opening system.}}
{{awareness}}{/əˈweənəs/}{意识；认知}{There is growing awareness of mental health issues.}}
{{balance}}{/ˈbæləns/}{平衡；余额}{It is important to maintain a work-life balance.}}
{{band}}{/bænd/}{乐队；带子；范围}{The band released their new album last week.}}
{{bankrupt}}{/ˈbæŋkrʌpt/}{破产的；使破产}{The company went bankrupt due to poor management.}}
{{base}}{/beɪs/}{基础；基地}{The company's base of operations is in New York.}}
{{basic}}{/ˈbeɪsɪk/}{基本的；基础的}{Everyone deserves access to basic healthcare.}}
{{bear}}{/beər/}{承担；忍受；熊}{Employees should not bear the entire burden of the cost.}}
{{behalf}}{/bɪˈhɑːf/}{代表；利益}{The lawyer spoke on behalf of the defendant.}}
{{being}}{/ˈbiːɪŋ/}{存在；生物}{Human beings have an innate desire to explore.}}
{{beloved}}{/bɪˈlʌvɪd/}{深爱的；心爱的}{The beloved teacher retired after 30 years.}}
{{bend}}{/bend/}{弯曲；弯道}{The road bends sharply to the left ahead.}}
{{beneath}}{/bɪˈniːθ/}{在...下方}{The treasure was buried beneath the old tree.}}
{{besides}}{/bɪˈsaɪdz/}{此外；除...之外}{Besides English, she also speaks French and German.}}
{{betray}}{/bɪˈtreɪ/}{背叛；泄露}{He felt betrayed by his closest friend.}}
{{bloom}}{/bluːm/}{开花；繁盛}{The flowers bloom beautifully in spring.}}
{{boom}}{/buːm/}{繁荣；隆隆声}{The tech industry experienced a major boom in the 2000s.}}
{{boost}}{/buːst/}{促进；增加}{The new policy is expected to boost the economy.}}
